				""
				"Machines can perform&aautomatic output via their output surfaces. To enable automatic output, click the corresponding button in the GUI. The automatic output of fluids and items is toggled separately. The automatic output can be further controlled through the&doverlay plate &r."
				""
				"Use the&5wrench&rto right-click the machine to change the output side, and shift-right-click to change the front."
